      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Of the 540 rank-and-file, riflemen: ten platoons, with the note that one platoon numbers 48 men. The arithmetic closes at 10 x 48 = 480 riflemen, leaving 60 rank-and-file who are not riflemen. The note is set as a two-column warichu, 但一小隊 on the right and 四十八人 on the left, offset by one glyph slot; at high magnification the two sub-columns are plainly distinct."
